scenario: DISKS-USB-01
title: Mount and eject a USB stick
area: Storage
rows: F-DISKS-02
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A USB stick with a few files.
step: Plug the stick in and open DISKS.
expect: The stick is listed with its name and size.
clause: listed
step: Press Open (mount).
expect: The stick's files appear in Files under media, with the right names.
clause: mount
step: Press Eject.
expect: The page says it is safe to remove, and the stick's light stops blinking.
clause: eject
step: Remove the stick and plug it in again.
expect: It is listed again and opens with the same files.
clause: again
